error[E0475]: 'source' is closed at the end of its 'using' block and cannot be returned
  --> $DIR/using-return.nra:12:16
   |
11 |     using (source = open()) {
   |     ----- 'source' is bound here, and closed when this block is left
12 |         return Result<Resource>.Ok(source);
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: use the resource inside the block, or keep what it produced instead of the resource

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0475`.
